TITLE Calcite kinetics with Ba and Cu, track SI(Witherite)
SOLUTION 1
    temp      200
    pH        2
    pe        4
    units     mmol/kgw
    Cu        10
    Ba        5
    -water    1

KINETICS 1
    Calcite
        -m0     1
        -m      1
        -parms  1.0  10
        -time_steps 1000 in 100
        -tol    1e-12

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -reset false
USER_PUNCH
    -headings step SI_witherite
    10 PUNCH STEP_NO, SI("Witherite")
END
